{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And five hundred of you shall pursue.</b> And a hundred fifths of you — a myriad shall pursue. Now the arithmetic comes out exact and equal: for just as there are twenty fifths in a hundred, so there are in a myriad twenty times five hundred, which are a hundred fifths. And our Rabbis, of blessed memory, expounded: ״ורדפו מכם חמשה מאה״ — and five hundred of you shall pursue — ״ומאה מכם רבבה ירדופו״ — and a hundred of you shall pursue a myriad. It should have said, 'and a hundred of you shall pursue two thousand,' according to the ratio of five hundred; but the few who do Torah are not like the many who do Torah.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:28:35.881768173Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}